
# basePath Chapter4

::FirstContractOpenCh4 
@trigger    OnContractSelectOpen
@cutscene
@once 

{@PAL}      	Wow, what a thrilling game of laser-tag! 
{@Quinn}    	Wait y'all played laser-tag without us?!
{@Joel}     	Oh, don't get all jambled, Quinnie.
{@Joel}     	Sorry Captain, she’s a huge fan of the Inter-System Laser Tag League. 
{@Quinn}    	One, don't call me Quinnie. 
{@Quinn}    	Two, he could have at least invited us. 
{@Quinn}	    …and go Kalvis Comets. 
{@Player}   	It was spur-of-the-moment; I'll invite you next time.
{@Quinn}    	Promise? 
{@Player} 	    Captain’s honor. 
{@Quinn} 	    Heh, maybe you’re cool after all. 

::BeforeSupplyChainCh4
@trigger    OnOverarchingLoaded
@when       IsSolutionFoundFor(Research), IsSolutionFoundFor(Design)
@cutscene 
@once 

{@PAL}      	It appears you have an automated message Captain from the Cu-6533-29.
{@Taryn}    	Hi Locke! 
{@Taryn}    	Just a heads up that our Phosphorus production has shut-down for the next few cycles. 
{@Taryn}    	We're taking time to celebrate the Kalvis Festival! 
{@Taryn}    	All other materials in our sector will still be available, but they may take some time. 
{@Player}   	Festival? Is that what Blaze was talking about? 
{@PAL}      	The Kalvis Sector tends to be... unrealiable with their... "holidays.”
{@Ovill}     	Which is why the Frosch sector is excited to announce a new Boron Station - 

::AfterSupplyChainCh4 
@trigger    OnOverarchingLoaded
@when       IsSolutionFoundFor(Research), IsSolutionFoundFor(Design), IsSolutionFoundFor(Supply)
@trigger
@once 

{@PAL}     	One thing to note Captain. 
{@PAL}     	The system is full of risks. 
{@PAL} 	    The higher the risk the more likely you’ll encounter a hiccup! 
{@Quinn} 	Good to know the bot has faith in us. 
{@Joel} 	With the pirates and the general deadly vacuum that is space…
{@Joel} 	P.A.L.’s not wrong. 
{@Player} 	Just stay safe you guys. 
{@Quinn} 	Aye aye, Cap’. 
